"We still need a layer that can bring the power of those models into the real workflows in the enterprise. And this is the opportunity for the applied AI layer."



@levie on @CNBC on why model progress alone is not enough, and why the companies bridging AI breakthroughs into real enterprise workflows are where the next years of value get created.


